<title>USA: DDJ Capital cuts stake in Liberte.</title>
<headline>DDJ Capital cuts stake in Liberte.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by DDJ Capital Management LLC, a Wellesley, Mass., investment advisor, said it cut its stake in Liberte Investors to 569,800 common shares or 4.69 percent of the outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include net sales of 138,300 common shares sold between July 22 and August 23. The price per share was not given.</p>
</text>
